<main class="os-main"><section class="os-hero pp-hero"><div class="os-kicker">STEP 12A • Product Order → Business OS</div><h1>Turn a saved Product & Price Pro quote into a traceable Business OS order.</h1><p>Finalization preserves the quote and product line snapshots, writes a new Product Sales raw-source record, creates the normalized order and maps exact VP/payable totals. Profit stays zero until a real cost basis is defined.</p><div class="os-status-row"><span class="os-chip <?= $error===null?'good':'' ?>"><?= $error===null?'PRODUCT SALES INTEGRATION LIVE':'Review required' ?></span><span class="os-chip good">No legacy rewrite</span><span class="os-chip">Explicit member link</span><span class="os-chip">Profit: deferred</span></div></section>
<?php if($error):?><div class="pp-alert bad"><strong>Integration diagnostic:</strong> <?= product_h($error) ?></div><?php endif;?><?php if($success):?><div class="pp-alert good"><strong>Saved:</strong> <?= product_h($success) ?> <a href="product_sale_detail.php?order=<?= (int)($_GET['order']??0) ?>">Open sale detail →</a></div><?php endif;?>
<?php if(!$error):?><section class="pp-grid" style="margin-top:14px"><article class="os-card pp-span-7"><div class="os-title-row"><div><h2>Saved Quotes</h2><p>Select a quote to review before finalizing it into Business OS.</p></div><a class="os-btn" href="product_order_builder.php">+ New Quote</a></div><div class="pp-table-wrap"><table class="pp-table"><thead><tr><th>Quote</th><th>Customer</th><th>Tier</th><th>Total</th><th>VP</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($quotes as $q):?><tr><td><b><?= product_h($q['quote_code']) ?></b><small><?= product_h(substr((string)$q['created_at'],0,16)) ?></small></td><td><?= product_h($q['customer_name']?:'—') ?><?= $q['member_name']?'<small>Linked: '.product_h($q['member_name']).'</small>':'' ?></td><td><?= product_h($q['pricing_tier_code']) ?></td><td><?= ps_money($q['grand_total']) ?></td><td><?= product_h(rtrim(rtrim(number_format((float)$q['total_vp'],3,'.',''),'0'),'.')) ?></td><td><span class="pp-badge <?= $q['order_id']?'':'warn' ?>"><?= $q['order_id']?'ORDER #'.(int)$q['order_id']:strtoupper((string)$q['status']) ?></span></td><td><a href="?quote=<?= (int)$q['id'] ?>">Review →</a></td></tr><?php endforeach;?><?php if(!$quotes):?><tr><td colspan="7">No saved product quotes yet.</td></tr><?php endif;?></tbody></table></div></article>
<aside class="os-card pp-span-5"><?php if(!$selected):?><h2>Choose a Quote</h2><p>Select a saved quote from the table. Nothing is written until you explicitly finalize it.</p><?php else:?><div class="os-title-row"><div><h2><?= product_h($selected['quote_code']) ?></h2><p><?= product_h($selected['customer_name']?:'No customer name') ?> • <?= product_h($selected['pricing_tier_code']) ?></p></div><span class="pp-badge"><?= count($selected['items']) ?> ITEMS</span></div><div class="pp-source"><b>MRP subtotal</b><span><?= ps_money($selected['subtotal_mrp']) ?></span></div><div class="pp-source"><b>Product payable</b><span><?= ps_money($selected['payable_amount']) ?></span></div><div class="pp-source"><b>Saving</b><span><?= ps_money($selected['saving_amount']) ?></span></div><div class="pp-source"><b>Delivery</b><span><?= ps_money($selected['delivery_charge']) ?></span></div><div class="pp-source"><b>Grand total</b><span><?= ps_money($selected['grand_total']) ?></span></div><div class="pp-source"><b>Total VP</b><span><?= product_h(rtrim(rtrim(number_format((float)$selected['total_vp'],3,'.',''),'0'),'.')) ?></span></div>
<?php if((int)($selected['order_id']??0)>0):?><div class="pp-alert good" style="margin-top:12px"><strong>Already finalized.</strong> Business OS Order #<?= (int)$selected['order_id'] ?>. <a href="product_sale_detail.php?order=<?= (int)$selected['order_id'] ?>">Open detail →</a></div><?php else:?><form method="post" class="pp-form" style="margin-top:14px"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<?= product_h($csrf) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="quote_id" value="<?= (int)$selected['id'] ?>"><label>Business Order Date<input type="date" name="order_date" value="<?= product_h(date('Y-m-d')) ?>" required></label><label>Link verified Member (optional)<select name="member_id"><option value="">No member link — preserve customer snapshot only</option><?php foreach($members as $m):?><option value="<?= (int)$m['id'] ?>"><?= product_h($m['full_name'].' • #'.$m['id'].($m['mobile']?' • '.$m['mobile']:'')) ?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></label><div class="pp-alert" style="background:#fff7ea;color:#805a20"><strong>Important:</strong> member identity is never guessed from the quote customer name. Select a member only when you know it is the same person.</div><button type="submit">Finalize into Business OS →</button></form><?php endif;?><?php endif;?></aside></section><div class="os-footer-note"><strong>Accounting policy:</strong> Business Order gross = MRP subtotal + delivery; discount = quoted saving; net = quote grand total; VP = quote total VP. Profit/Income is deliberately not auto-created until a real cost/profit rule is defined.</div><?php endif;?></main></div></body></html>